<title>BRAZIL: Bus crash kills 12 in Brazil.</title>
<headline>Bus crash kills 12 in Brazil.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve people died and 22 were injured when a bus and truck collided in southern Brazil early on Monday, police said.</p>
<p>&quot;We're not sure yet if the bus ploughed into the truck or the other way round,&quot; a spokesman for the federal police in the southern city of Pouso Alegre said. The 12 killed died on the spot, he added.</p>
</text>
